Subject: [PATCH 21/33] STRATA_QSA_KV_ROLE (round 9, ported): a QSA layer's k
 and v GEMVs as front blocks of its q GEMV (opt-in, with NR3)

Pair-typed roles (Q6_K / IQ4_XS pairs, 2-4 columns; a q in Q6_K at 4 columns falls back to three launches). Two fewer
critical-path launches per QSA layer on top of STRATA_QSA_NR3. mmvq_g11_parity: OK, 576 kv role runs bitwise.
